    <briefdescription>
<para>Represent one information held inside an operand bundle of an llvm.assume. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>AttrKind is the property that holds. WasOn if not null is that <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_value" kindref="compound">Value</ref> for which AttrKind holds. ArgValue is optionally an argument of the attribute. For example if we know that P has an alignment of at least four:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>AttrKind will be Attribute::Alignment.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>WasOn will be P.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ArgValue will be 4. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
